/*
# Seed Remaining States Data — Pan-India coverage (31 states/UTs)

Extends the database from the initial 5 states to all 36 states/UTs of India.
District names match the TopoJSON `district` properties exactly so every
district highlights and is clickable on its state map.

States added: Andhra Pradesh, Arunachal Pradesh, Assam, Bihar, Chhattisgarh,
Gujarat, Haryana, Jharkhand, Karnataka, Madhya Pradesh, Maharashtra, Manipur,
Meghalaya, Mizoram, Nagaland, Odisha, Punjab, Sikkim, Telangana, Tripura,
Uttar Pradesh, Uttarakhand, West Bengal, Andaman and Nicobar Islands,
Chandigarh, Dadra and Nagar Haveli and Daman and Diu, Delhi,
Jammu and Kashmir, Ladakh, Lakshadweep, Puducherry.

Idempotent: all INSERTs use ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.
*/

-- ============ STATES ============
ON CONFLICT (name) DO NOTHING;

-- ============ DISTRICTS ============
ON CONFLICT (state_id, name) DO NOTHING;

-- ============ TOURIST SPOTS ============
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ============ ACCOMMODATIONS ============
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
